{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-31","kind":"proposition","title":"合数一定有素因子","englishTitle":"Any composite number is measured by some prime number.","book":7,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.31/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","contentId":"euclid-7-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1e7bcb2c229288c83a64492d5b4d197a6c7c5d7a201847007b5f9ce5b3a2a0b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-31.statement","euclid-7-31.construction.1","euclid-7-31.proof.1","euclid-7-31.construction.2","euclid-7-31.proof.2","euclid-7-31.proof.3","euclid-7-31.construction.3","euclid-7-31.proof.4","euclid-7-31.proof.5","euclid-7-31.proof.6","euclid-7-31.proof.7","euclid-7-31.proof.8","euclid-7-31.proof.9","euclid-7-31.proof.10","euclid-7-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"756322521c63870759b49b2f8fd96f6849494aa71a691d7fb59f5d907bee4768","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Any composite number is measured by some prime number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何合数都能被某个素数整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d3da2dc4c897267a33f9851350f129f1fd4f7b6e9d15c7f5fc9e8b094035bb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be a composite number; I say that A is measured by some prime number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A成为合数;我说,A是大约素数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf61e614ec5659726cba09ff7e2d3be8cb543e253f4c8697280532887f742135","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is composite, some number will measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A是复合的,所以有些数字是整除"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e4cb5e91a8743a518acb14c192cbb8209fec34c7ad2b002d2764a4db9113d44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure it, and let it be B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"数到整除,B"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d55da931d84261e0b14fd686907553bb9a9994ab58b31897d9633f0eebf11ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, if B is prime, what was enjoined will have been done."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果B是首要的, 被命令的就已经做了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eadff91d5c9414eb3657cd577626feed665c7a578d4b74f282822c58f20a4390","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if it is composite, some number will measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但如果是复合的, 某些数字会是整除它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de3ce94d64edf24b2f94ae16362d17d4eb06df1d906bdf0dbd61ed1e8b292739","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure it, and let it be C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"数到整除,C"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"360f7192fa0c53fd63138e7b21a3c2d2350b400e044d89874fb9e04ad12ef6a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since C measures B, and B measures A, therefore C also measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,从C 整除 B,A和B 整除 A,C也是整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f424701c364e8a469dc654f98774812f5349427540913ad79dee90b8043ee7de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if C is prime, what was enjoined will have been done."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果C是首要的, 被命令的就已经做了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eadff91d5c9414eb3657cd577626feed665c7a578d4b74f282822c58f20a4390","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if it is composite, some number will measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但如果是复合的, 某些数字会是整除它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b503d97237af71fae3d2a4c85cac1ffc6eec0f626a29e15d4458e22c443f3e7d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus, if the investigation be continued in this way, some prime number will be found which will measure the number before it, which will also measure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果继续这样进行调查,将发现大约素数,这个数字将达到整除,其中整除也将达到A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45fb042309e29f180413d4c2a3fd75c3b3e05223066b0736cc8bd14bc961db25","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if it is not found, an infinite series of numbers will measure the number A, each of which is less than the other: which is impossible in numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果找不到,无限的序列数 将达到整除 A, 每一个都比另一个少: 以数字来说是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8fae090629496817357b867f0c39fdff27dd2492672d7f91898409a536f937fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore some prime number will be found which will measure the one before it, which will also measure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,将发现大约素数个,届时将发现整除个,届时还将发现整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebd55a8b28a738f28da52c9e0b790af2a303ce3dcf168193f9db131765e52f62","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore any composite number is measured by some prime number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,任何合数个单位的整除值约为素数个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-31.source","contentId":"euclid-7-31","revisionId":"euclid-7-31@raw-d1e7bcb2c229288c","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78891b61b59d32a4012d64847c3695b7caef8031f2fb695d48784c08e48f0fed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016